      "default": "Shop Our <strong>Premium Series</strong>&nbsp;&amp; Get Rewarded.&nbsp;<br>Receive <strong><span style=\"color: rgb(208, 2, 27);\">a </span><span style=\"color: rgb(208, 2, 27);\">$15 Gift Card</span></strong> for Each&nbsp;item purchased.&nbsp;<br><strong>Buy more, earn more.</strong>"
    },
    {
      "type": "html",
      "id": "pf_76edc56c_value",
      "label": "Heading2 — Value",
      "default": "<strong></strong>Our Story"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "pf_18f124e5_value",
      "label": "Text — Value",
      "default": "We bring better vision to HER."
    },
    {
