      "default": "Heading text"
    },
    {
      "type": "html",
      "id": "pf_e5044871_value",
      "label": "Text — Value",
      "default": "\nThis campaign celebrates her strength, her lifestyle, and the warmth designed specifically for her. Venustas creates heated apparel around how women move, live, and feel in the cold — supporting her comfort, confidence, and freedom outdoors. <br><br>Not resized.&nbsp;Not remarketed. Just warmth, thoughtfully made for her."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "pf_40f95266_value",
      "label": "Text — Value",
      "default": "Born from Care"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "pf_40f95266_placeholder",
      "label": "Text — Placeholder",
      "default": "Heading text"
    },
    {
      "type": "html",
      "id": "pf_6606f987_value",
      "label": "Text — Value",
      "default": "Our story began on a freezing hike in the Rocky Mountains, where our founder, Michael, saw how heavy layers and bitter cold were taking away his wife’s comfort and freedom. In that moment, a simple idea took root—<strong>warmth should enable life, not restrict it.</strong><br><br>Michael then set out to create outerwear that could replace bulk with intelligent, reliable heat. After developing the first prototype, he knew this was the answer and founded VENUSTAS with this vision. His wife, Cindy, joined him in product development and material sourcing.<br><br>At its heart, this brand was born from care—<strong>for her, and for everyone </strong>who deserves to feel warm, confident, and free in the cold."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "pf_899d9dda_value",
      "label": "Text — Value",
      "default": "Built by Women"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "pf_899d9dda_placeholder",
      "label": "Text — Placeholder",
      "default": "Heading text"
    },
    {
      "type": "html",
      "id": "pf_da4c609e_value",
      "label": "Text — Value",
      "default": "Over <strong>70% of Venustas&nbsp;team are female</strong>, including key roles such as product managers. From fit and fabric to every small detail, the female perspective is deeply involved in every stage of product development. <br><br>Each piece is tested, worn, and refined through real experience to ensure it’s not only warm, but truly comfortable to wear. We don’t just design for women — <strong>women help create the warmth solutions they genuinely need.</strong>"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "pf_5f3f4ab5_value",
      "label": "Text — Value",
      "default": "Made for Real Needs"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "pf_5f3f4ab5_placeholder",
      "label": "Text — Placeholder",
      "default": "Heading text"
    },
    {
      "type": "html",
      "id": "pf_b59fc29a_value",
      "label": "Text — Value",
      "default": "Women feel cold differently — and Venustas is designed with that truth in mind. From heating placement to silhouette, every detail is shaped around real needs, including better core coverage, full-body warmth, and comfort during sensitive times.<br><br>We focus on where women need warmth most, using lightweight, skin-friendly materials and tailored fits that <strong>feel as good as they look</strong>.<br><br>Not hotter — just warmer in the way women truly need."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "pf_903ca5ba_value",
      "label": "Text — Value",
      "default": "Care in Every Detail"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "pf_903ca5ba_placeholder",
      "label": "Text — Placeholder",
      "default": "Heading text"
    },
    {
      "type": "html",
      "id": "pf_ba33e1c0_value",
      "label": "Text — Value",
      "default": "Every Venustas piece is created with thoughtful design and carefully selected, skin-friendly materials. We combine graphene linings for efficient heat retention, premium down for lasting insulation, and our <strong>Venustas-Warm™ heating technology</strong> to deliver warmth that feels natural, comfortable, and reliable.<br><br>At the same time, we remain mindful of our impact by using <strong>recycled </strong>materials, <strong>responsibly sourced</strong> down, and <strong>fluorine-free</strong> water-repellent finishes.<br><br>Because true care is reflected not only in how a product performs, but in what it’s made of."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "pf_cb7f2d45_value",
      "label": "Text — Value",
      "default": "Why Does She Need Heated Apparel？"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "pf_1be2e366_value",
      "label": "Text — Value",
      "default": "More Sensitive to Cold"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "pf_66bdf12e_value",
      "label": "Text — Value",
      "default": "Women’s circulation at the extremities is more easily affected, making hands, feet, and the core feel cold faster."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "pf_d312505b_value",
      "label": "Text — Value",
      "default": "Core Warmth Is Essential"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "pf_5ba09efc_value",
      "label": "Text — Value",
      "default": "Keeping the abdomen, lower back, and hips warm is especially important for comfort—particularly during colder days and sensitive times."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "pf_46120d0c_value",
      "label": "Text — Value",
      "default": "Bulky Layers Limit Comfort"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "pf_0c3ad3bf_value",
      "label": "Text — Value",
      "default": "Traditional layering feels heavy, restrictive, and often compromises both mobility and style."
